# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M4 "Select + drag while paused = teleport" (M2 "Select + drag"): the Select tool picks H2's
# nucleus 0 and drags it 0.2 view units (90 px at 900 px tall) to the right while paused: each
# motion is a teleport (MoveNucleus) and the run stays paused. On the default camera that lands
# the nucleus 2.740 Bohr from nucleus 1 (its drag plane runs through the nucleus, parallel to the
# focus plane). View coordinates: offsets from the 3D view's centre in half its height (replay.rs).
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
# pinned at the merge of main (2026-10-14): written for the presets' own 49^3 x 0.25 grid (Balanced)
# without container walls, before the app defaulted to Accurate (81^3) with walls on; H2 is the
# R = 1.6 Bohr scene it was written for (h2_r16.scene; the h2 preset is 1.45 Bohr now)
action ionic none
action quality balanced
action walls off 4.5
scene h2_r16.scene
wait idle
action tool select
t 100 cursor 0.1043005 0.0244677
t 110 button left down
t 130 cursor 0.2043005 0.0244677
t 150 cursor 0.3043005 0.0244677
t 160 button left up
wait idle
expect selected 0
expect paused true
expect dist 0 1 2.70 2.78
expect no-error
